JavaScript Reduce Function:
```javascript
function reduce(arr, initial, callback) {
    let accumulated = initial;

    (async () => {
        for await (const num of arr) {
            try {
                accumulated = await callback(accumulated, num);
            } catch (error) {
                console.error('Error in callback:', error);
                throw error;
            }
        }

        return accumulated;
    })();
}
```

